      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0008",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "At any time after [`pauseSpeaking(at:)`](nsspeechsynthesizer/pausespeaking(at:).md) is called, [`continueSpeaking()`](nsspeechsynthesizer/continuespeaking().md) can be called to continue speaking from the beginning of the word at which speech paused.",
      "normalizedSource": "At any time after [`pauseSpeaking(at:)`](nsspeechsynthesizer/pausespeaking(at:).md) is called, [`continueSpeaking()`](nsspeechsynthesizer/continuespeaking().md) can be called to continue speaking from the beginning of the word at which speech paused.",
