      "normalizedSource": "Sending [`continueSpeaking()`](nsspeechsynthesizer/continuespeaking().md) to a receiver that is not currently in a paused state has no effect on the synthesizer or on future calls to the [`pauseSpeaking(at:)`](nsspeechsynthesizer/pausespeaking(at:).md) function.",
